#. module: cux_mrp_base
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_cux_mrp_base
msgid ""
"\n"
"MRP Base Extension\n"
"==================\n"
"\n"
"Adds a \"Production Line\" master data model to the Manufacturing app,\n"
"supporting a multi-level parent-child hierarchy:\n"
"\n"
"- Factory (level 1, top)\n"
"- Shop Floor (level 2)\n"
"- Production Line (level 3)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"制造基础扩展\n"
"==================\n"
"\n"
"在制造应用中增加"生产线"基础数据模型，支持多级父子结构：\n"
"\n"
"- 工厂（第 1 级，顶级）\n"
"- 车间（第 2 级）\n"
"- 产线（第 3 级）\n"

